{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "7d536099d6a41adb0d9151cf1371fc17c3b9192d4b530e40da4a982750b9f6a8", "ja": "えへへ、この衣装、すっごくいい感じだよね～。\n自分、気にいっちゃったぞ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，这套服装感觉超棒的耶～\n本人很喜欢喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
