{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "b8d484372871a828de723a70a15381fa6031d48eea22164821ee0edb222fe3f7", "ja": "あ、そうだ！\nせっかくだから、何かお返しするねっ。", "zh": "啊，对了！\n就趁这个机会，让本人送你回礼吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "d00507843d5f7da7a08ab06e0618a79775c3586daf816e9d9dec32ad3d830f4e", "ja": "いま欲しいものとかある？\n自分が用意できるものならプレゼントしてあげる！", "zh": "你现在有想要的东西吗？\n只要是本人买得起的，本人都能送你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
