{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a664a107aa07e377387f96a1158d919aece962ad21b773880ac0b0a0e413c56b", "ja": "響の、その気持ちだけで充分かな。", "zh": "你有这份心意就足够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "27bc45ee5e6b3ba13ab873bdebd0db50f61a1f915096f5b465a2d8fc49bca629", "ja": "えっ、でも……。うう、自分が贈りたいんだから、\n素直に何か欲しがってよ～！", "zh": "咦？可是……唔唔，本人想送你礼物，\n你就坦率点，说想要什么嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6a879f2b74fa6f4671ebe5cdf76fcb5f7efd70565805e9c4716ad19b9914099f", "ja": "そ、そう言われても……。", "zh": "就、就算你这么要求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "56fbaa61243651a39a0d64b857e2add56972e341bbb5c7a4a799f08b9f3e0b9e", "ja": "あっ、セーターとか欲しくない？\n自分編み物がトクイだから、何か編んであげる！", "zh": "啊，你想不想要毛衣？\n本人很擅长编织喔，就替你织点东西吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "ef9d677ce9ac7710b6abcd3f0180e6d085b01675c35bd99b4e0dbacd6c46bf02", "ja": "どんな服でもいいから、リクエストしてみて！\nマフラー？　帽子？　カーディガンでもいいぞっ！", "zh": "不管想要怎样的衣服都行，你说说看吧！\n要围巾？还是帽子？就算是开襟衫也可以喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1013_p", "source_sha256": "53dac3658bfc121c3a05c7f6b00c8890d30a388f2bbdf4901f4f94c5a02858d7", "ja": "服はひと通り持ってるからなぁ。\nすぐには思いつかないけど……。", "zh": "但该有的衣服我都有了啊，\n一时想不到要什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "1024848b04cfacf26274571e808fee14d525b760300766ba253f71d3333cf646", "ja": "ええ～。それじゃ何を作っていいか\nわからないぞ～。ホントになんにもないの？", "zh": "怎么这样～这样本人不晓得该织什么才好～\n你真的什么都不需要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0c7c10877be045e0c4c85b30a4bb16156753bff003279cd497697f7d411315bb", "ja": "そうだな。あえていうなら……、\n響のプロデュースに役立つものが欲しい、かな？", "zh": "这个嘛，硬要说的话……\n我想要可以用来培育响的东西吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "a1e32f9da7d7bf7799263e540ab6b5c25a3b9cb3d62c1fea7f072be5ca630809", "ja": "自分のプロデュース……？　うーん～～～。\n……ダメだ、ゼンゼン思い浮かばないぞ……。", "zh": "培育本人……？嗯～\n……不行，完全想不出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "50e0ea3543198d404ebd5d2e4b363c96049fb4ed4a34af69a72e9b519ab40cd7", "ja": "よしっ！　{$P$}。\nこれから自分と出かけよう！", "zh": "好！{$P$}，\n你现在跟本人出门吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e6610794b32ec79ec79323c365d6f86f024ed2bfd3121b8c88f0a82bae47a8ed", "ja": "えっ、これから？　まあ、少しだけなら\n構わないけど、どこに行くんだ？", "zh": "咦？现在吗？如果只是一下子是没关系，\n但要去哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "2c813058b8a05ef7bdc42779248eba0d4a9706d10b768600b939bdb0e2b351df", "ja": "自分のいきつけの洋服屋さん！\nあそこなら、いろんな服があるからねっ。", "zh": "去本人常去的服饰店！\n那里的衣服种类很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "1763ce2be34af429a411fa57ce3f0dd285c4735c00cb38b1146fe5a15b92910f", "ja": "もし欲しいのが見つかったら、自分に言って。\n同じものを作ってあげる！", "zh": "一旦发现想要的衣服，就立刻跟本人说。\n本人会帮你做一模一样的出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b798062984f18600ed07a78097ed6f20fddb7c73c7faff78947edd2d28f069fd", "ja": "……わかった。そこまで言ってくれるなら、\nお言葉に甘えて、行ってみるかな。", "zh": "……我知道了，既然都说到这个份上，\n我就照你说的去看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "f03945054555c1fcdd4e8819751c6e73c7d434c12e1b555db4ae7398981a2f7a", "ja": "えへへっ、決まりだぞ！　それじゃあ自分、\nすぐ着替えてくるから、ちょっと待ってて！", "zh": "嘿嘿，那就决定了喔！\n那么本人立刻去换衣服，你等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0104_1023_p", "source_sha256": "8152a1acb706c6b1780a175dde1c5c94758300ef1924b422f3b89e91c5331d1f", "ja": "（響に作ってもらうもの、か……。よし、靴下でも\n作ってもらおうかな。あんまり大変じゃなさそうだし）", "zh": "（响要织给我的衣服啊……好，就拜托她帮我织袜子吧。\n毕竟袜子织起来应该不会太辛苦。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
